BOSS Scorchion Blink
    Events
        Time - Every 10.00 seconds of game time
    Conditions
        (BossScorchion is alive) Equal to True
    Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionPoint = (Position of BossScorchion)
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionTargetGroup = (Units within 700.00 of BossScorchionPoint matching ((((Matching unit) is alive) Equal to True) and (((Matching unit) belongs to an enemy of (Owner of BossScorchion).) Equal to True)).)
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionTarget = (Random unit from BossScorchionTargetGroup)
        Set VariableSet BossScorchionTargetPoint = (Position of BossScorchionTarget)
        -------- =================================== --------
        If (All Conditions are True) then do (Then Actions) else do (Else Actions)
            If - Conditions
                UnitIsCasting[(Custom value of BossScorchion)] Equal to False
                (Unit-type of BossScorchionTarget) Not equal to Totem
                (Unit-type of BossScorchionTarget) Not equal to Bag
                (Unit-type of BossScorchionTarget) Not equal to Companions
            Then - Actions
                Cinematic - Send transmission to (All players) from BossScorchion named Scorchion: Play Scorchion02 <gen> and display Fire away..  Modify duration: Set to 2.30 seconds and Don't wait
                Unit - Add Blink (Scorchion) to BossScorchion
                Unit - Order BossScorchion to Night Elf Warden - Blink BossScorchionTargetPoint
                Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the origin of BossScorchion using Abilities\Spells\Other\Volcano\VolcanoMissile.mdl
                Special Effect - Destroy (Last created special effect)
                Special Effect - Create a special effect attached to the origin of BossScorchion using Abilities\Spells\Other\Volcano\VolcanoMissile.mdl
                Special Effect - Destroy (Last created special effect)
                Wait 0.50 seconds
                Unit - Remove Blink (Scorchion) from BossScorchion
            Else - Actions
        -------- =================================== --------
        Custom script:   call DestroyGroup(udg_BossScorchionTargetGroup)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossScorchionPoint)
        Custom script:   call RemoveLocation(udg_BossScorchionTargetPoint)
        -------- =================================== --------
